| Feature           | Internal Fragmentation         | External Fragmentation             |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |
| Waste Location    | Inside allocated block         | Between allocated blocks           |
| Cause             | Fixed-size allocation          | Variable-size allocation           |
| Memory Available? | Yes, but unusable inside block | Yes, but scattered                 |
| Common In         | Fixed Partitioning, Paging     | Dynamic Partitioning, Segmentation |
| Compaction Helps? | ❌ No                           | ✅ Yes                           |
| Severity          | Usually smaller                | Can become severe                  |
